<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6976" root="حبل" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبْلَانَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبْلَى</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبْلَانُ</span> (tropical:)  <i>Full</i>
[of beverage, or wine, and of water; see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبِلَ</span>];
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبْلَان</span></b> : fem. of the former <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبْلَى</span>; and
of the latter; ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبْلَى</span></b>  [which is anomalous]: (AHn,
ISd, K, TA:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْبَلُ</span></b>  a man <i>full of beverage</i>
or <i>wine.</i> (Z, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبْلَانُ</span> (tropical:)  <i>Angry;</i> (K,
TA;) <i>full of anger;</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَى فُلَانٍ</span> <i>against such a
one:</i> (TA:) fem. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>. (Ibn-'Arafeh, K, TA.)

